  "land": "midway",
  "facing": "west",
  "contract": "a two-cell ring spoked to a hub and straddled by two masts, and A RIDE: a soul-sand bubble column lifts you 52 courses up the front mast to a gallery at the axle, and a walled chute drops you back into the same three-course channel you set off from, which cancels the fall entirely. The shaft has no door because a water shaft cannot have one - you swim in under the casing - and the whole water body is proved leak-free by simulation before the design is emitted.",
